                              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                              "Text": "Vernalisation responses are based on those described by [Brown_Anthesis_2013].   Vernalisation is assumed to be related to the expression of the Vrn1 Gene.  Its experssion is accumulated daily and daily upregulation as a function of development (DeltaHaunStage) and a TempResponseProfile that declines exponentially from a maximum at 1^o^C to zero at 0^o^C and at 20^o^C.",
